      "content": "thanks for this. it looks pretty good for the board. \n\njust one thing though—i noticed when i was skimming the raw engineering numbers that the turnover there looked a bit higher than usual this quarter. i don't want to make a mountain out of a molehill, but i'm worried a sharp question from the board might catch us off guard if we don't address it. \n\ncan you double check that engineering segment and see if there's a way to characterize that turnover in the summary? maybe frame it in a way that doesn't trigger an alarm bell about instability? i want to keep the focus on the positive trends you mentioned.",
